**Goal:** Add a token-authenticated JSON API at `/api/*` so an iOS app can consume all Resumegen features without touching the existing Inertia/web layer.

**Architecture:** Laravel Sanctum provides token auth — users POST email+password to `/api/auth/login` and receive a Bearer token stored on-device. All `/api/*` routes use the `auth:sanctum` guard. API controllers live in `App\Http\Controllers\Api\` and are thin wrappers that reuse existing service classes and model methods; they never import Inertia.

**Tech Stack:** Laravel 13, Laravel Sanctum v4 (already installed), PHP 8.4, SQLite

